# --- local tooling and working notes ---------------------------------------
# Not part of the published package. These stay on disk; git just stops
# tracking them.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
/backup/

# --- vendor documentation --------------------------------------------------
# Ameriabank's own document, received as an email attachment. Not ours to
# redistribute.
docs/*.pdf

# --- sandbox discovery probes ----------------------------------------------
# Scratch, and never tracked. The probes settled the spec ambiguities
# empirically before any SDK code was written; what they established is
# recorded in CONVENTIONS.md §4 and in docs/DEVELOPMENT-HISTORY.md, which is
# where a reader should look. The scripts and their reports stay on disk and in
# the local archive, and neither the scraper nor its output belongs in a
# distributed package.
/probe/

